@startuml SQ16_View_Customer_Purchase_History
title UC23 - View Customer Purchase History & Daily Invoices Sequence Diagram (Code-based Flow)
autonumber "1:"
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12

skinparam sequence {
    LifeLineBorderColor #000000
    LifeLineBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantBorderColor #000000
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ParticipantFontColor #000000
    ParticipantFontSize 12
    ActorBorderColor #000000
    ActorBackgroundColor #7ACFF5
    ActorFontColor #000000
    ArrowColor #000000
    ArrowFontColor #000000
    GroupBorderColor #000000
}

actor "Pharmacist" as Pharmacist #7ACFF5
participant "<<boundary>>\nDailySalesPage.jsx" as DailySalesPage #7ACFF5
participant "<<boundary>>\nCustomerHistoryDrawer.jsx" as HistoryDrawer #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nDailySalesAPI.js" as DailySalesApi #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nsalesApi.js" as SalesApi #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nDailySalesController" as DailySalesController #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nSalesInvoiceController" as InvoiceController #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nDailySalesServiceImpl" as DailySalesService #7ACFF5
participant "<<control>>\nSalesInvoiceServiceImpl" as InvoiceService #7ACFF5
participant "<<entity>>\nSalesInvoiceRepository" as InvoiceRepository #7ACFF5
database "<<entity>>\nSQL Server (PMS DB)" as DB #7ACFF5

activate Pharmacist #7ACFF5
== Flow 1: Retrieve Daily Retail Invoices List ==
Pharmacist -> DailySalesPage: Navigate to "Hóa Đơn Bán Lẻ Trong Ngày" tab
activate DailySalesPage #7ACFF5

DailySalesPage -> DailySalesApi: getDailyInvoices({ storeId: 1, date: '2026-11-08', page: 0, size: 10 })
activate DailySalesApi #7ACFF5

DailySalesApi -> DailySalesController: GET /api/daily-sales/invoices?storeId=1&page=0&size=10
activate DailySalesController #7ACFF5

DailySalesController -> DailySalesService: getDailyInvoices(storeId, today, pageable)
activate DailySalesService #7ACFF5

DailySalesService -> InvoiceRepository: findDailyInvoicesByStore(storeId, startOfDay, endOfDay, pageable)
activate InvoiceRepository #7ACFF5
InvoiceRepository -> DB: SELECT i.id, i.code, c.full_name, c.phone, i.final_amount, i.status FROM sales_invoices i LEFT JOIN customers c ON i.customer_id=c.id WHERE i.store_id=? AND i.created_at BETWEEN ? AND ?
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> InvoiceRepository: Page<SalesInvoiceSummaryDto>
deactivate DB
InvoiceRepository --> DailySalesService: Page<SalesInvoiceSummaryDto>
deactivate InvoiceRepository

DailySalesService --> DailySalesController: Page<SalesInvoiceSummaryDto> (includes customer info, final amount, status)
deactivate DailySalesService

DailySalesController --> DailySalesApi: HTTP 200 OK + ApiResponse.success(page)
deactivate DailySalesController

DailySalesApi --> DailySalesPage: Page<SalesInvoiceSummaryDto>
deactivate DailySalesApi

DailySalesPage --> Pharmacist: Render invoices table with customer name, phone, and Action buttons ("Chi tiết", "Trả hàng")

== Flow 2: Live Search by Invoice Code, Customer Name, or Phone ==
Pharmacist -> DailySalesPage: Type "3910" or "Lê Hoàng Long" into search bar
DailySalesPage -> DailySalesPage: Execute instantaneous client-side filter (matching code, customerName, or phone)
DailySalesPage --> Pharmacist: Real-time update table rows with matching invoices

== Flow 3: Look Up Customer Past Purchase History at POS (F7) ==
Pharmacist -> HistoryDrawer: Press "Lịch sử mua hàng (F7)" while customer is selected (ID=101)
activate HistoryDrawer #7ACFF5

HistoryDrawer -> SalesApi: getCustomerPurchaseHistory(101)
activate SalesApi #7ACFF5

SalesApi -> InvoiceController: GET /api/v1/sales/invoices/customer/101 (Bearer AT)
activate InvoiceController #7ACFF5

InvoiceController -> InvoiceService: getCustomerPurchaseHistory(101)
activate InvoiceService #7ACFF5

InvoiceService -> InvoiceRepository: findByCustomer_IdOrderByCreatedAtDesc(101)
activate InvoiceRepository #7ACFF5
InvoiceRepository -> DB: SELECT * FROM sales_invoices WHERE customer_id=101 ORDER BY created_at DESC
activate DB #7ACFF5
DB --> InvoiceRepository: List<SalesInvoice>
deactivate DB
InvoiceRepository --> InvoiceService: List<SalesInvoice>
deactivate InvoiceRepository

InvoiceService --> InvoiceController: List<SalesInvoiceResponse>
deactivate InvoiceService

InvoiceController --> SalesApi: HTTP 200 OK + ApiResponse.success(list)
deactivate InvoiceController

SalesApi --> HistoryDrawer: List<SalesInvoiceResponse>
deactivate SalesApi

HistoryDrawer --> Pharmacist: Open drawer sliding from right, display historical medicine items and "Sao chép đơn cũ vào giỏ POS" button
deactivate HistoryDrawer
deactivate DailySalesPage
deactivate Pharmacist
@enduml